  "description": "Repairs r-def-cursor-dao/querydef-maxrecords-effect: QueryTimeout is not a QueryDef member (GetIDsOfNames 0x80020006); the DAO member is ODBCTimeout. A temporary QueryDef over \"SELECT ID, N FROM T ORDER BY ID\": read MaxRecords and ODBCTimeout; for MaxRecords 3, 1, 0, 100 and -1: assign, read it back, and for a snapshot and a dynaset opened from the QueryDef read RecordCount, MoveLast, RecordCount, then close; finally assign MaxRecords the string \"abc\" and Null, with Errors read after each. Asks whether MaxRecords limits a local recordset, its accepted values and read-back, and the ODBCTimeout value of a local query. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
